{"4203300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stealth-Rogue-Escape", "steam_appid": 4203300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Prepare for sweaty palms.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an operative tasked with retrieving monopolized technology.<br>Stay hidden and complete your recovery mission swiftly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH</strong><br>Think of this mission as a deadly game of &quot;hide-and-seek&quot;—you must avoid combat whenever possible.<br>Weapons and equipment must be scavenged on-site. Explore every corner of the floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUE</strong><br>The terrain is procedurally generated, changing randomly with every playthrough and every floor.<br>If the mission fails, you start over from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong><br>Recovery doesn't end when you grab the item. The mission isn't over until you're out.<br>A timer starts the moment you touch the technology. You must race back to the starting point before time runs out.<br>Speed is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Darling, let's get to work.&quot;</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Prepare for sweaty palms.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an operative tasked with retrieving monopolized technology.<br>Stay hidden and complete your recovery mission swiftly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH</strong><br>Think of this mission as a deadly game of &quot;hide-and-seek&quot;—you must avoid combat whenever possible.<br>Weapons and equipment must be scavenged on-site. Explore every corner of the floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUE</strong><br>The terrain is procedurally generated, changing randomly with every playthrough and every floor.<br>If the mission fails, you start over from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong><br>Recovery doesn't end when you grab the item. The mission isn't over until you're out.<br>A timer starts the moment you touch the technology. You must race back to the starting point before time runs out.<br>Speed is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Darling, let's get to work.&quot;</strong></i></p>", "short_description": "Stealth-Rogue-Escape is a stealth action game that combines old-school stealth, roguelike elements, and escape sequences to liberate monopolized technology.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203300/58537b54a2320015c440863bdf6bc9fa7ddfd9a1/header.jpg?t=1770973159", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203300/abab9943e417a6d50051810c830f0ab992925d1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770973159", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203300/abab9943e417a6d50051810c830f0ab992925d1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770973159", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) Version 1909 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> ８ GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650